Statement of modification
-------------------------

  donor.py IS A MODIFIED DERIVATIVE of the work named above. It is inlined
  byte-for-byte from dqn_market_scorer so this agent can bundle its frozen field
  policy without importing another agent. The derivative adds bounded Q-network
  guidance to _role_plan: animal_gate may block new herd roles and seed_scale
  may reduce new crop roles. Existing plants and animals remain assigned so
  learned choices cannot suppress their field care. This agent invokes the
  default guidance and does not invoke the donor's market planner.

  Every other file in this directory is original work of this repository.
